{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"ingot_copper","model_identifier":"ingot_copper","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"## ingot_copper\n\nResource prop, ingots.\n\n- Cubes: 12 (0 rotated). Texture 64x64, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -4.0..4.0, y 0.0..6.8, z -5.0..5.0 (size 8.0 x 6.8 x 10.0 u = 22 x 19 x 28 cm).\nIngot stack (copper): six ingots (each ~23 x 8.5 x 6 cm = 8 x 3 x 2.25 u, a slab with a narrower top step) stacked 3 / 2 crossed / 1, for forge and storehouse yards. Each ingot is its own pair of cubes (`ingot_N`, `ingot_N_top`) so the game can hide ingots as stock drops; one ingot alone (`ingot_5`) also serves as a carried single ingot (hand). World prop: stands on the ground at y = 0, centred on the origin (forges, storehouses).\n"},"description":"## ingot_copper\n\nResource prop, ingots.\n\n- Cubes: 12 (0 rotated). Texture 64x64, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -4.0..4.0, y 0.0..6.8, z -5.0..5.0 (size 8.0 x 6.8 x 10.0 u = 22 x 19 x 28 cm).\nIngot stack (copper): six ingots (each ~23 x 8.5 x 6 cm = 8 x 3 x 2.25 u, a slab with a narrower top step) stacked 3 / 2 crossed / 1, for forge and storehouse yards. Each ingot is its own pair of cubes (`ingot_N`, `ingot_N_top`) so the game can hide ingots as stock drops; one ingot alone (`ingot_5`) also serves as a carried single ingot (hand). World prop: stands on the ground at y = 0, centred on the origin (forges, storehouses).\n","resolution":{"width":64,"height":64},"elements":[{"name":"ingot_0","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-4.0,0.0,-5.0],"to":[4.0,1.5,-2.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[24,8,32.0,9.5],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[49,13,52.0,14.5],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[32,8,40.0,9.5]